{"seq":8,"slug":"pharmacology-basics","title":"药理学基础","stage":"DONE","category":"health-medicine","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/pharmacology-basics","rating":{"composite":3.8,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 药理学基础\n\n药理学研究的是药物与生命体之间的相互作用，而这种相互作用始终是双向的：身体对药物做了什么（药代动力学），以及药物对身体做了什么（药效学）。这个 hub 把药理学的入门骨架拆成四条主线，按从「分子原理」到「临床落地」的顺序层层递进，让你既见树木也见森林。\n\n第一条主线是**药理学基础**：药物如何与受体结合（亲和力与内在活性两个属性）、剂量与效应之间的量效曲线如何刻画安全边界（治疗指数、治疗窗），以及药物世界如何按机制、用途、来源与法律状态被分类。这一章奠定了后续一切讨论的概念词汇——储备受体、效价与效能、窄治疗窗等，都在这里第一次出场。\n\n第二条主线是**药代动力学**，回答「身体对药物做了什么」。药物经历吸收、分布、代谢、排泄（ADME）的旅程：生物利用度与表观分布容积决定它去了哪里，CYP450 酶系与肾脏清除决定它停留多久，而半衰期把分布与清除合成为给药方案的关键常数——「一日三次」背后是一道维持血药浓度落在治疗窗内的工程题。\n\n第三条主线是**药效学与机制**，回答「药物对身体做了什么」。激动剂与拮抗剂的分野（占位是否干活）、四大受体超家族下游的信号放大通路、酶与转运体这些受体之外的靶点，共同解释了药物为何这样起效；而耐受、依赖与个体差异则提醒我们，效应从来要再乘上「这个具体的人」这个修正系数。\n\n第四条主线是**安全与应用**，把前三章收拢为负责任的实践：不良反应与药物相互作用如何在多重用药中放大风险，新药如何穿过三期临床试验的层层筛选才赢得信任，以及合理用药如何用「五个对」把分子层面的理解转化为对一个具体患者的决策。四条主线环环相扣——基础提供语言，药代与药效提供机制，安全应用提供落地，最终汇成一张相互交叉引用的知识网，而非孤立的条目堆叠。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"药理学基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/pharmacology-basics/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"drug-action-receptors","title":"药物作用与受体","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/pharmacology-basics/foundations/drug-action-receptors"},{"seq":2,"slug":"dose-response-window","title":"量效关系与治疗窗","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/pharmacology-basics/foundations/dose-response-window"},{"seq":3,"slug":"drug-classification","title":"药物分类概览","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/pharmacology-basics/foundations/drug-classification"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"pharmacokinetics","title":"药代动力学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/pharmacology-basics/pharmacokinetics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"absorption-distribution","title":"吸收与分布","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/pharmacology-basics/pharmacokinetics/absorption-distribution"},{"seq":2,"slug":"metabolism-excretion","title":"代谢与排泄","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/pharmacology-basics/pharmacokinetics/metabolism-excretion"},{"seq":3,"slug":"half-life-dosing","title":"半衰期与给药方案","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/pharmacology-basics/pharmacokinetics/half-life-dosing"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"pharmacodynamics","title":"药效学与机制","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/pharmacology-basics/pharmacodynamics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"agonist-antagonist","title":"激动剂与拮抗剂","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/pharmacology-basics/pharmacodynamics/agonist-antagonist"},{"seq":2,"slug":"signaling-targets","title":"信号通路与靶点","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/pharmacology-basics/pharmacodynamics/signaling-targets"},{"seq":3,"slug":"tolerance-variability","title":"耐受依赖与个体差异","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/pharmacology-basics/pharmacodynamics/tolerance-variability"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"safety","title":"安全与应用","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/pharmacology-basics/safety","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"adverse-interactions","title":"不良反应与药物相互作用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/pharmacology-basics/safety/adverse-interactions"},{"seq":2,"slug":"drug-development-trials","title":"药物研发与临床试验","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/pharmacology-basics/safety/drug-development-trials"},{"seq":3,"slug":"rational-use","title":"合理用药","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/pharmacology-basics/safety/rational-use"}]}]}